{
  "name": "Lead Generator v6 — Serper + Multi-Page Email Crawl, No SMTP",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ One-time Setup\n\n**1. Sheets to create** (same spreadsheet as before)\n- `API Keys` tab (unchanged from v4/v5): `api_key | owner | daily_limit | daily_count | last_reset | active`\n- **NEW** `Jobs` tab: `job_id | status | keyword | location | total_written | created_at`\n- **NEW** `Leads` tab: `job_id | business_name | phone | website | address | email | created_at`\n\n**2. Credentials**\n- Google Sheets (reuse existing)\n- Serper.dev Header Auth (reuse existing, `X-API-KEY`)\n- OpenAI or Gemini (reuse existing, for sub-area query generation only — no qualification/scoring)\n- ❌ No SMTP needed anymore\n\n**3. Two webhooks, both must be Active**\n- `POST /lead-generation` — submits a search, returns `{ jobId, allowed, reason }` immediately\n- `GET /lead-status?jobId=...` — polled by the frontend every few seconds until `status: \"done\"`\n\n**4. Why this replaced email delivery**\nSMTP added a dependency and a delay. The frontend now polls for results directly and offers a client-side download (JSON/TXT) — no email server, no deliverability risk, instant on-page results.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "v6-0001",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [0, 0],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📈 Why the email hit-rate was only ~10%\n\nv4/v5 only checked the **homepage**. Most businesses put contact emails on `/contact` or `/about` instead. This version crawls up to 3 pages per business (home, /contact, /about) and keeps the first real email found — roughly doubling to tripling hit rate at near-zero extra cost (just more HTTP fetches, no paid API involved).\n\n## 💵 Real cost math (Serper Starter tier, $50 = 50,000 queries)\n- 1 query ≈ $0.001\n- 25 queries/day (≈200 leads each ≈ 5,000 leads/day) ≈ $0.025/day ≈ **$0.75/month**\n- The 5/sec rate-limit error you hit earlier was the **free trial tier**. Starter tier raises that to 50/sec.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "v6-0002",
      "name": "Cost & Coverage Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [800, 0],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
